OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi to White House and
OL,4,Asays he is 'proud' of US-China
OL,5,Arelationship
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says the US and China have
OL,8,Fmade "tremendous strides on the issues
OL,9,Ffacing our two countries" as he
OL,10,Fwelcomes Xi Jinping to the White House
OL,11,Ffor talks
OL,13,FTrump says he and Xi will discuss
OL,14,F"security, technology and super
OL,15,Fintelligence" - the US president's name
OL,16,Ffor artificial intelligence
OL,18,FPresident Xi, meanwhile, calls for
OL,19,F"continued dialogue" with the US and
OL,20,Fhopes that "Chinese companies are
OL,21,Ftreated fairly here"
