OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi to White House and
OL,4,Asays he is 'proud' of US-China
OL,5,Arelationship
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore Xi arrived at the White House,
OL,8,FTrump again said he did not want more
OL,9,FAI regulation. "I want to leave it
OL,10,Fexactly where it is," he wrote online.
OL,11,F"That is China's position also"
OL,13,FTech bosses and AI executives will join
OL,14,FTrump and Xi at a state dinner later
